      "text": "Intact-link candidate: inspect continuously from boundary 0; trolley B4-B7 during 0-3 and B8-B11 during 3-6, then hand carry B12 during 6-7. Boundary completion ordering permits both full unloads. B9 inspection runs 8-10; B12 completes at 13. Finite-model prediction: nine transferred, twelve correct releases, 120 released brackets, seven occupied transfer minutes and thirteen inspection minutes; no rack wait."
