      "text": "Feasible separating comparator: replay P2 alone with P1 idle, recording unloads, correct releases, occupancy and both occupied intervals; compare with the intact candidate. Three releases versus twelve defeats P2-only sufficiency. This parent-alone comparator disables delivery and cannot identify a link-ablation effect. Any intact shortfall or transfer wait defeats the proposed schedule prediction."
